<TXSPN>Shiyo 804, April 8, 6:32 a.m.―<PG>
"We are now over the Arata district. 
{PAUSE ""}
The fire appears to have burned itself out. 
{PAUSE ""}
The settlement is almost entirely burned down. We can't see anyone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
―Check for any evacuated residents in the vicinity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Roger."<PG>
