"One person sighted, one person sighted in a clearing nearby. 
{PAUSE ""}
Just the one. We can't see anyone else."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
―Can you confirm signs of life?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, lying spread-eagled. Unknown if alive or dead."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
―Can you land nearby?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, we can land in a <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="へいたん">flat</STYLE> clearing nearby."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
―Good. Determine at once whether alive or dead, and transport to the hospital.<PG>
"Roger. Determining at once whether alive or dead, and transporting to the hospital."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
